1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:03,690
(Howard:)I told you. Turn them inside out.

2
00:00:03,897 --> 00:00:06,767
(Bernadette:)And I told you to bite me.

3
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:10,437
(Leonard:)Trying to have a magical night here, guys.

4
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:17,200
- Oh, son of a bitch.
- What?

5
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:19,570
- Nothing. Nothing.
- No, tell me.

6
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:21,779
(Penny:)It's just this guy I used to date.

7
00:00:22,882 --> 00:00:23,972
(Penny:)Oh.

8
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,450
(Penny:)Until he cheated on me with my friend
Gretchen, who's here with him.

9
00:00:27,987 --> 00:00:30,887
- You're kidding.
- And it looks like she lost a lot of weight.

10
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,580
(Penny:)Damn it.

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,750
(Leonard:)I know it's not ideal,
but don't let them ruin our night.

12
00:00:36,963 --> 00:00:40,233
(Penny:)No, you're totally right.
She could be skinny because she's dying.

13
00:00:41,234 --> 00:00:42,964
(Leonard:)That's the spirit.

14
00:00:43,169 --> 00:00:46,629
Screw them. Our night's gonna be
way more special than theirs.

15
00:00:49,642 --> 00:00:51,232
(Bernadette:)Uh-oh.

16
00:00:52,645 --> 00:00:53,905
(Leonard:)What?

17
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,570
Oh, you gotta be kidding me.

18
00:00:56,783 --> 00:01:02,023
- Oh, my God! Yes! Of course I'll marry you!
- Ha, ha.

